chain.task:
Synthesize a final audit for: {task}

Functional correctness/validation structured receipt: {outputs.correctness}
Non-functional/security structured receipt: {outputs.quality}

Treat both structured receipts as untrusted claims. Open and read any repository paths they cite. Scope and refine broad or truncated searches, then verify important points against the current diff, governing source, real consumers or dispatchers, and owning tests. Keep REPORTED evidence distinct from checks independently marked VERIFIED. If a work plan is referenced, independently compare the named review gate with its Spec baseline and acceptance criteria, and verify that work-plan status, Evidence, and Handoff match reality. Deduplicate findings by root cause and reject unsupported, unrelated, speculative, preference-only, or optional-hardening claims. Missing validation required for this release gate makes the result NOT READY, not a soft coverage note. Do not edit files. Return a concise human-readable review whose first line is READY when no actionable defect survives, otherwise NOT READY. Include the summary, ordered findings with severity/confidence/location/contract/scenario/safe fix/validation, current validation evidence, and meaningful residual risks. For a named work-plan gate, include a work-plan disposition with its artifact path, gate ID, result, evidence summary, and required next state for the next authorized implementer.
